{
  // 全库唯一的「摘要」篇：三条 rule 一一对齐三篇正文（core / pipe / chat），此外不放任何内容。
  //
  // 定位：回答「能干什么、这件事该去哪篇看」，不回答「怎么用」。
  // 硬约束——**不重抄参数、选项、文法**：任何具体用法一律 `skills get <core|pipe|chat>` 现取。
  // 本篇一旦超过 ~2KB 就说明抄多了，砍回去，别演变成第二个 core。
  //
  // 为什么用英文：读者主要是 AI，而命令名/算子名/字段名本就是英文，中英混排会为同一概念
  // 产生两个 token 形态；正文三篇仍是中文，人读的入口在 docs/use/。
  //
  // has-chat / no-chat 不拆两份清单：每条末尾一句 `chat:` 标明该组能力在 chat 侧的三态
  // （有同名工具 / 没有 / 明令禁止），两类消费者读同一份各取所需。
  //
  // 排版靠数据而非代码：renderSkill 的既有形态是「description 作三级标题、pattern 作副行」，
  // 故 description 首行写短标题、清单跟在其后（markdown 里只有首行进标题，其余落正文）。
  // 摘要是数据，不该为它改渲染器。JSON5 无模板字符串、也不能用 + 拼接，多行一律写在一行里用 \n。
  //
  // triggers 只吃「总览类」词，与三篇正文刻意不重叠（core 吃说明书词、pipe 吃管道词、
  // chat 吃 AI 词、obsidian-base-spec 吃语法词），故 recall 一个词只落到该去的那一篇。
  name: "summary",
  description: "What x-basalt can do, one screen. Three groups: core (query & edit), pipe (batch), chat (natural language). Pick one, then `skills get <core|pipe|chat>` for the whole page — or `skills list <name>` then `skills get <name> <id>...` to pull just the entries you need (a single entry is often <1/6 of the page).",
  triggers: [
    "summary",
    "overview",
    "capabilities",
    "摘要",
    "总览",
    "概览",
    "能干什么",
    "能做什么",
    "有什么功能",
    "该用哪个",
    "从哪开始",
  ],
  rules: [
    {
      id: "core",
      pattern: "x-basalt skills get core",
      description: "core — query & edit one vault\n\n- `index` / `scan` — build & refresh the SQLite index\n- `query` — DQL over structured fields (frontmatter/tags/links); **cannot search body text**\n- `search` — FTS5 over body text; use when you don't know which note\n- `meta` — read/write frontmatter; the only write path for a single file\n- `base` — run a `.base` view headless\n- `parse` — single-file AST\n- `watch` — daemon, re-index on change\n\nchat: same tools, except `index` and `base` (not exposed) and `watch` (**forbidden** — never returns, hangs the session).",
    },
    {
      id: "pipe",
      pattern: "x-basalt skills get pipe",
      description: "pipe — batch-edit many files in one run\n\n- `run --pipe` — the only way to edit >1 file; **never loop `meta set`**\n- source — scan diff (default) / `where=<full DQL>` / `--stdin`\n- ops — `actions=` seven classic actions, `step=` full operator set\n- writes — dry-run unless `--apply`; index auto-refreshed afterwards\n\nchat: yes — `pipeline_run{where, steps}`.",
    },
    {
      id: "chat",
      pattern: "x-basalt skills get chat",
      description: "chat — drive all of the above in natural language\n\n- needs `AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY`; without it only this command is off, the rest work\n- **add `--quiet` (or `--json`) whenever a script or another AI calls it** — otherwise the whole plan→act→observe trace lands in your context\n- one-shot with an argument; omit the argument for a REPL\n\nchat: this *is* the chat path — the skill lists all 15 tools and the CLI command each maps to.",
    },
  ],
  metadata: {
    doc: "docs/use/README.md",
    self_recall: true,
  },
}
